    <string name="about_app_description">MultiSensor Data Collection is a mobile app that collects data from various sensors, including the accelerometer, gyroscope, geolocation, video camera, microphone, battery consumption, and more. It enables the creation of a synchronized dataset locally.\n\nAuthor: rafael.pezzuto@gmail.com\nVersion: 2.2.0\nPrivacy Policy: https://github.com/rafaelpezzuto/multi-sensor-data-collection/blob/main/privacy-policy.md\nSource Code: https://github.com/rafaelpezzuto/multi-sensor-data-collection\n\nThis app is part of SideSeeing, a computer vision and machine learning project focused on developing methods for Urban Informatics applications.\n\nVisit our website: https://sites.usp.br/sideseeing.
